title: "Active Vision Face Monitoring Scaffold"
abstract: "A hardware-agnostic, testable engineering scaffold for 2-DOF PID gimbal face tracking and real-time fatigue monitoring (EAR, PERCLOS, head pose), with passive/no-servo mode, SIL, replay, and a Raspberry Pi reference backend."
